        <div class="card">
            <input type="checkbox" id="event-name" name="accordion">
            <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
                <img src="/images/cultural-events/Oath Taking.webp" alt="Oath Taking"
                    style="width: 526px; height: 317px; object-fit: cover;">
                <h5 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 0.75rem; padding-inline: 1rem;">Internatinal Nursing Day
                    Celebration & Oath Taking
                    Ceromony</h5>
                <p>
                    A memorable Lamp Lighting &amp; Oath Taking Ceremony was held on 25th January to honor our
                    nursing students as they embark on their noble journey.
                    Graced by our esteemed Chief Guest, Mrs. Minati Dash, Assistant Nursing Superintendent, PGIMER
                    &amp;Capital Hospital, Bhubaneswar, the event was filled with inspiration, encouragement, and
                    joy.
                    The students showcased their talents with captivating dance performances, followed by a heartwarming
                    prize distribution ceremony.
                    A heartfelt thank you to Mrs. Dash for sharing her wisdom and sparking motivation among future
                    caregivers.
                </p>
            </div>
